name rorlink
category Package
revision 67461
shortdesc Create ROR symbols which links to the given ROR-IDs
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides an easy to use command. It takes an URL
longdesc of the Research Organization Registry (ROR) as argument and
longdesc creates a ROR symbol which links to the given URL -- very
longdesc similar to the orcidlink package from which it is derived. The
longdesc symbol itself always fits with the choosen font size.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/rorlink/rorlink.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://gitlab.com/lukeflo/rorlink-latex-package/-/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/lukeflo/rorlink-latex-package
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/rorlink
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics hyper graphics-symb
catalogue-version 1.1.0
